  message: "Implemented option (c) — index-only embedding. PR #3831 merged. _emit_handler_slices now appends result.to_dict() to behavior_map['features'] before slice-file-specific mutations add inline nodes/edges/meta. Per-handler features[] entries hold spec-compliant id/name/entry_nodes/node_ids/edge_ids/query/limits_hit; node_ids/edge_ids are graph-ID pointers into top-level nodes[]/edges[], not duplicated content. Full denormalized slice payloads remain in <out-stem>.slices/slice.handler.<...>.json files for offline/portable consumption. Stable feature ID matches spec formula sha256(json.dumps(query, sort_keys=True)) via SliceResult.feature_id. Handlers over the cap (default 25) excluded from features[] but indexed elsewhere. Spec section §features[] updated to document the index-vs-content split. Four new pin tests in test_handler_slices.py. 4659 tests pass; 100% coverage."  # 5df9
